{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Dish O' The Sea is a ",["l","烹饪","cooked dish"],". It is prepared using either the kitchen inside an upgraded ",["l","农舍","farmhouse"]," or a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],". It may also randomly appear in ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],"' shop on ",["l","周循环#Saturday","Saturdays"]," or the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 660–1,100g. Five Dish O' The Sea may occasionally be found in a ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure room"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],". One Dish O' The Sea is a guaranteed silver tier reward on the 12th and 13th for the ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," festival. Two Dishes O' The Sea may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"]," or ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"."]],["p",["The reward for completing the Fish Tank, master fisher's Bundle, or quality fish Bundle is 5 Dish O' The Sea."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","莱纳斯","Linus"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","威利","Willy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Dish O' The Sea is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["p",["Dish O' The Sea is not used in any recipes."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Dish O' The Sea is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Shirt O' The Sea"],". ",["f","Shirt214.png",24]," It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a yellow dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Dish O' The Sea is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". ",["l","威利","Willy"]," is now neutral towards Dish O' The Sea."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can now be prepared using a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],". Now a reward for the Quality Fish and Master Fisher Bundles."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Now a prize for the ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," festival. Added as possible prize from ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es and ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"es. Quality Fish and Master Fisher Bundles now reward five Dish O' The Sea instead of one."]]]]]]]}